    "quality_summary": "The sales_data table contains 186 rows with several data quality concerns: mixed transaction_id formats (sales vs returns), inconsistent date formats, a small percentage of missing store_id values, negative quantities and total_amounts indicating returns, and inconsistent values in customer_segment (e.g., 'Prem', 'Bgt'). All other columns have full coverage, but some categorical values (customer_segment, category) show spelling variations. The products table is clean with no missing values and consistent identifiers.",
